  "independence_caveat": "densenet121-res224-all was trained on NIH + PadChest + CheXpert + MIMIC + RSNA. Its CheXpert component was trained on these very report labels, so the reader is only partly independent of the thing being audited, and AUC-against-report is biased upward. That bias pushes the literal gap negative and is the likeliest reason it comes out so."
